> graph MCP server is available, use the exact tools `mcp__backend_graph.query_graph`,
> `mcp__backend_graph.get_neighbors`, `mcp__backend_graph.shortest_path`,
> `mcp__backend_graph.get_pr_impact`, and `mcp__backend_graph.god_nodes`. If no graph/CLI is
> present, continue with normal search and record the unavailable reason for reviews. Detail:
> `skills/shared/graphify-lookup.md`.

